                                "sense_id": "42667c27-c363-38bb-a370-ff0eb35bc242",
                                "text": "“Every person,” replied Ellen, deeply blushing, “is warranted in giving their opinion of another. No human creature is perfect; but where the good qualities of any character predominate, I should certainly be inclined to overlook the lesser imperfections which might shade it.”\n“Admirable sophistress!” said the Signora archly […]"
